{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.poster.avif?t=1764584488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.webm?t=1764584488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.mp4?t=1764584488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcadian Days is a solo developed exploration game that encourages player initiative and curiosity as they discover the world of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Romanian landscape and culture, Arcadian Days aims to both be a meditative experience that respects players time and perhaps teaches you about a world that is almost never explored in any media.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear and freeing exploration. discover this world at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a one-of-a-kind world, inspired by Romanian and Eastern European landscapes, filled with detail and a relaxing music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hard quests. No combat. No frills. Just you, the land and a small task list from your parents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist interface that allows for a staggering amount of interaction and choice with the world around you. Simple, tactile actions that reflect a child's view of the world\u2014creative, emotional, and free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord for announcements, development updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610170?t=1764584488","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610170?t=1764584488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/1141174f43c4e570f22d9ff8b7b3a2a78e5baf5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764584488","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/1141174f43c4e570f22d9ff8b7b3a2a78e5baf5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764584488","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.poster.avif?t=1764584488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.webm?t=1764584488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.mp4?t=1764584488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcadian Days is a solo developed exploration game that encourages player initiative and curiosity as they discover the world of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Romanian landscape and culture, Arcadian Days aims to both be a meditative experience that respects players time and perhaps teaches you about a world that is almost never explored in any media.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear and freeing exploration. discover this world at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a one-of-a-kind world, inspired by Romanian and Eastern European landscapes, filled with detail and a relaxing music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hard quests. No combat. No frills. Just you, the land and a small task list from your parents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist interface that allows for a staggering amount of interaction and choice with the world around you. Simple, tactile actions that reflect a child's view of the world\u2014creative, emotional, and free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord for announcements, development updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more!</p>","developers":["IMMERSIV GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/6daba9a5c3814b291dd713cd5ebc1857ba6c40d0/header.jpg?t=1764584488","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/720261847/ff5878932230638a09627072cbc15561d51f69e1/1758970332/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758971174","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/720261847/ff5878932230638a09627072cbc15561d51f69e1/1758970332/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758971174","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/720261847/ff5878932230638a09627072cbc15561d51f69e1/1758970332/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758971174","id":257141382,"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shar